/// partner downloads as-is. Not a blueprint: it carries no fields, cannot
/// be instantiated, and is not activated. Not the `ReferenceMaterial`
/// resource deleted on 2026-09-22 (its six operations, ARN and record are
/// gone). That was partner-uploaded and addressable; this is AWS-authored
/// template content with no identity of its own.
