/// view, plus one thing it does not report: a Facebook connection with no
/// Page reads `active` there but cannot post (`PAGE_REQUIRED`). There is
/// deliberately no "authorizing" value: a connection exists only once
/// consent has completed, so an unfinished consent is simply not in the
/// list.
